# The messages at the top of the screen: a cheat, the message going
# after four seconds, the key that shows it again, a message that
# replaces another, the key that turns the messages off (its message
# stays; a cheat then shows nothing), and on again. The level starts
# at frame 41, after the wipe of the warp.
50 press i
52 press d
54 press d
56 press q
58 press d
70 shot iddqd.ppm # Degreelessness Mode On
197 shot before.ppm # the last tic of the message
198 shot after.ppm # gone
220 press enter # shows it again
225 shot refresh.ppm
240 press i
242 press d
244 press k
246 press f
248 press a
252 shot idkfa.ppm # Very Happy Ammo Added, in its place
270 press f8 # Messages OFF
275 shot off.ppm
290 press i
292 press d
294 press d
296 press q
298 press d
302 shot offcheat.ppm # Messages OFF stays; the cheat shows nothing
460 press f8 # Messages ON
465 shot on.ppm
480 press i
482 press d
484 press d
486 press q
488 press d
492 shot iddqd2.ppm     # Messages ON must stay: the cheat waits
605 shot waited.ppm     # then the cheat: Degreelessness Mode On
640 quit
